# The build context is the directory holding both checkouts, which may hold
# a good deal else. Everything is excluded, and exactly what the Dockerfile
# copies is let back in: never node_modules, dist, .git, or a local workspace,
# which is somebody's data and never belongs in an image.
#
# BuildKit reads this file because it sits beside the Dockerfile and shares
# its name; a .dockerignore at the context root would apply to every build
# from that directory, which is not this repository's to decide.
*
!dango/package.json
!dango/package-lock.json
!dango/tsconfig.json
!dango/src
!mochiforge/src
